# MD_analysis Project Structure

## Layout

- `src/` — all analysis modules (each in its own subpackage).
- `src/mdchat/` — the LLM chat platform (skills, registry, LLM engine, CLI).
- `scripts/` — CLI entry-point scripts for batch analysis.
- `legacy/` — deprecated monolithic workflow (reference only).

## Imports

- Modules reference each other via `from src.ModuleName import ClassName`.
- The repo root must be on `sys.path` (handled by `pyproject.toml` editable install or `.vscode/settings.json` PYTHONPATH).

## Running MDChat

```
pip install -e ".[chat]"
# copy .env.example to .env and set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (or GEMINI_API_KEY + MDCHAT_PROVIDER=gemini and pip install -e ".[gemini]")
mdchat
```

Or press **F5** in VS Code / Cursor (uses `.vscode/launch.json`).

## Adding dependencies

- Core analysis deps go in `pyproject.toml` under `[project] dependencies`.
- MDChat-specific deps go under `[project.optional-dependencies] chat`.
- Visualization-only deps go under `viz`.
